<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\pc_keyboard.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "VOICE" "1000" "3000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\五島パソコン.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>Golden Week ends today, and tomorrow it's school again.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So tonight I'd skip the late nights I've been keeping and be in bed before the date changed.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That was the plan―<PG>
Right now I'm typing at my computer keyboard, and in front of me is a huge pile of books borrowed from Motoki University.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was Golden Week, but I pushed them into opening up for me.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "0" "PASS"}
{MESON "500"}
A few hours ago I talked with <STYLE ID="1">Sis</STYLE> for the first time in ages―<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\五島家玄関.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Hey."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That was when I was talking with <STYLE ID="1">Sis</STYLE> about the <STYLE ID="2">Eiichiro Niimura</STYLE> death accident.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\桃子バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\絶対何か居る雰囲気のアレ.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "BGM" "1000" "5000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> know... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I guess it can't be helped if you don't remember, but... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">do you really think that accident was just an accident?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Huh?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Sure, there were a lot of witnesses to that accident. But I bet not many actually saw the moment he fell. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I didn't see the moment either."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, what's wrong with you today? You're acting weird."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"The Megasawa City case and the flayed-body case, do you think they were really solved?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"What do you mean...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> saw the moment of the accident."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"I did...?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yeah. Right after the accident... you told me."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Told you what...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"That somebody pushed him and he fell."</STYLE><PG>
Pushed by someone...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I couldn't quite follow what she meant.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There were many witnesses; it was an accident, no doubt about it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No, I was 3 at the time.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The possibility that I saw wrong is more than enough.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If anything, that's the only possibility.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Somebody... who?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I don't know that much. </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> were the only one who saw."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"H-hey, did I say anything else!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Anything else...?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Yeah! Any little thing is fine!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"But it's been 12 years already... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Hmm... come to think of it..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\sceneswitch2.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\罅（ひび）\桜3.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\五島子供.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "14" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, are you okay?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Yeah..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Back then I'd just seen the moment a person died, so I felt sick...<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"What was that weird sound just now?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Who knows..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"That was amazing!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　It went bwooooo! Like a trumpet!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"You're right..."</STYLE><PG>
True, now that she mentions it, a sound like that suddenly ringing out is stranger than a person falling to their death.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And then the wind suddenly blew...<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"And then, and then, out of a hole, a hand stretched out, shwooop!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"A hole?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Yeah! A hand like long black hair, shwooop!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\五島家玄関.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\桃子バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"That's about all I remember."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Sorry, you were going to the convenience store. I got in the way."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\室内歩き.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
With that, <STYLE ID="1">Sis</STYLE> went back to the living room.<PG>
I was just <STYLE ID="4" RUBY="ぼうぜん">dumbfounded</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No, there had been a vague sense that something was off.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Eiichiro Niimura-san</STYLE>'s accident really did happen.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
One thing led to another, and it developed into the flayed-body case, but...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even so, too much about it is inexplicable.<PG>
What I'd call the most inexplicable is the spiriting-away-style method of the crimes.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The police aren't stupid either, so they must have considered every possibility and run every kind of investigation.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But it hasn't been solved.<PG>
............ 
{PAUSE ""}
No, that wasn't it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The incidents aren't solved because they're too inexplicable for the police to handle―
{PAUSE ""}
or there's one more reason I can think of.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The possibility that the police forcibly halted the investigation.<PG>
Suppose everything <STYLE ID="1">Sis</STYLE> told me earlier is true.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
To sum up her story: a sound like a trumpet rang out, the wind blew, a hole opened, a long black hand stretched out of it, and <STYLE ID="2">Eiichiro Niimura-san</STYLE> was pushed off.<PG>
Going by the story alone, it sounds like nothing but a supernatural phenomenon.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But I deny it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There are no supernatural phenomena in this world.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It only means that present-day common sense cannot yet explain it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Examine each piece one by one, and cause and effect are bound to exist.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\桃子バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Huh? You're still here?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, you work part-time at a cafe somewhere, right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Huh? Yeah."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Does it get regulars from Motoki-cho?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Well, there are quite a few regulars."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Please! </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, help me!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Huh?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Um... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">I know it's sudden and pushy, but..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Me, help </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Erina</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Yeah..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\桃子横顔.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Sis</STYLE> looked down, seemingly deep in thought.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
More than deep in thought... 
{PAUSE ""}
she seemed somehow troubled, or at a loss...<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\桃子バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Okay. What do I do?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "Lucky_You.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Th-thank you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I-it's not like... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But am I any use?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"I don't know, but no harm in trying."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I see... What do I do?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Among the cafe regulars, is there a Motoki University professor or staff member?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Let's see... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Yeah, there is. Someone who's a professor of cultural anthropology, I think."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Can you get in touch with that person?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Huh...?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Well, I can, I guess... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But I just turned that guy down the other day..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Please! It's really important!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Haah... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Fine, all right. It's </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Erina</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> asking, after all."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\pc_keyboard.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "VOICE" "1000" "3000" "PASS"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\五島パソコン.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
And so, that's why a mountain of Motoki University's precious holdings is piled in front of me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The Arata settlement―
{PAUSE ""}
that is, the place tied to <STYLE ID="5">Niimura-senpai</STYLE>, I'm going to investigate thoroughly.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The flayed-body case remains unclear, but I can't rule out that the Arata settlement was somehow involved in the Megasawa City case.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If the Arata settlement was involved in the spiriting-away-style method...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "日没廃校.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "3000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\裏\本積み重ね.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I went back and forth between the computer and the books.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Whether there was any information on the Arata settlement, what kind of place it was.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> herself doesn't seem to know much about the Arata settlement, so asking around can't be relied on.<PG>
About all I found out online was 'almost nothing is known about the Arata settlement.'
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Apparently it's state-owned land, and no one may enter without permission.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But even so, people live there.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A place so little known on the internet―
{PAUSE ""}
in other words, a place known to only a very limited few.<PG>
That's where these books come in.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
These books lay out, without holding anything back, information that isn't on the internet.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
They had been tucked away deep in a storeroom of the university library.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Probably almost no one knows what's in these books.<PG>
Even the professor <STYLE ID="1">Sis</STYLE> introduced me to said this was the first time seeing any of it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So researching on my own is more efficient than asking people.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What caught my interest among them―<PG>
The author of these books was a researcher named Hajime Shinozaki.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
He wrote in them about the Arata settlement, and about a fungus called <STYLE ID="6">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
From the contents, it seems these were meant to be presented to the people of the Arata settlement.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Yet for some reason they're here.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Probably the originals are elsewhere, and these are copies.<PG>
Droga.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The Arata cherry.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Walking corpses.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Every last thing like something out of myth or fairy tale.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But this is a proper research work, written on the basis of numerous experiments and investigations.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\ノック.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Yes?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\室内ドア開閉.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\五島の部屋夜.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\桃子バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Still up?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Yeah..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"It's already 11 at night. You've got school tomorrow, right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Yeah, but just a little longer..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I heard you haven't eaten dinner either?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Oh... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Now that you mention it..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\ビニール.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">Sis</STYLE> held out a plastic bag.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Leftovers from today's staff meal."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"You're giving it to me...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"You don't want it?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="3">"I-I want it!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I accepted the bag meekly.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Sis</STYLE> is strangely kind today.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\夕焼け.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\裏\まかない.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
